================================================================================
openforms-mui
================================================================================
A clean-room re-implementation of the OpenForms FormSchemaJSON contract as an
MUI runtime. NO upstream renderer or builder source is vendored — the TypeScript
types and diagnostics were derived from the published schema reference and
observed semantics.

  Upstream schema contract: OpenForms (github.com/henriquefps/open-forms)
  Upstream license:         Apache License 2.0
  Pinned reference version: 1.0.7

Runtime dependencies (installed on demand under
.pi/skills/openforms-mui/tools/node_modules) carry their own licenses:
React, @mui/material, @mui/x-date-pickers, @emotion/*, react-hook-form, zod,
dayjs, @fontsource/roboto. See each package for terms.

================================================================================
bpmn-package-explorer
================================================================================
Vendors the pre-built bpmn.io viewers and a Node layout bundle for buildless,
offline operation.

  bpmn-js, dmn-js  — bpmn.io License (MIT + watermark obligation)
                     Full text: .pi/skills/bpmn-package-explorer/assets/LICENSE.bpmn-io.txt
  bpmn-auto-layout — see vendored bundle provenance in
                     .pi/skills/bpmn-package-explorer/assets/VENDORED.md

  WATERMARK OBLIGATION (bpmn.io License): the source displaying the bpmn.io
  watermark linking to https://bpmn.io MUST NOT be removed, changed, or visually
  overlapped. The vendored viewers keep it fully visible in every rendered
  diagram. Do not disable it.

Optional OpenForms form rendering inside a BPMN user task follows the OpenForms
Apache 2.0 attribution above.
